HorusRD is a modified version of RustDesk (https://github.com/rustdesk/rustdesk).
It was changed by Grisas starting in 2026: renamed and rebranded to HorusRD,
with new icons, a reduced user interface, build-time configuration of the
rendezvous server and key, and adjusted build and packaging scripts. See the
git history of https://github.com/gtf-dot/rustdesk for the full list of changes.

